  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In the condensation polymerization reaction, the elimination of small molecules such as water,&nbsp;alcohol, hydrogen chloride takes&nbsp;place.</p><p>Nylon,&nbsp;a condensation polymer, is made of hexamethylene diamine and adipic acid.</p><p>Buna<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi></math>, Teflon&nbsp;and Neoprene are addition polymers.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0051_777504be08d0.png\" style=\"width: 379px; height: 336px;\" /></p>"
